{"id": "book006-b000000-p000-6191ff49d5", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 0, "part_index": 0, "kind": "title", "translatable": false, "language_hint": "mixed", "source": "# 选择纪全", "source_sha256": "6191ff49d5e0a403bc3b973b83bf66c0186547e794cfee7b3e53fe061996e4a9", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000001-p000-581480b8ff", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 1, "part_index": 0, "kind": "source_note", "translatable": false, "language_hint": "mixed", "source": "> 来源：410.入地眼全书+玉尺经+葬经+鲁班经+选择纪全+秘诀仙机.pdf，PDF 第 323–336 页", "source_sha256": "581480b8ffb87d4bfe0eb6a77ccecbe6ca3651849047646e7e8c50bd20202366", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000002-p000-4c6d828fe2", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 2, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "明錢塘胡文煥德父校正貞觀元年正月十五日", "source_sha256": "4c6d828fe2b083221a5c224f73c0b51338f3f4f0432ecb423e14fccd156c1657", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000003-p000-15b816a367", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 3, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "和尚奏萬姓設齋之日值遇凶帝故爲咎者豈是不按藏經內值吉神可用之日所以致此臣今藏經內錄如來選擇紀奏", "source_sha256": "15b816a367febc85f0e15167fb3d0c60aa476bbc710c984cfea26447f1c81a5f", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000004-p000-2d11fd65d9", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 4, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "甲子日是善財童子在世撿齋還愿者子孫昌盛福生招財大吉利", "source_sha256": "2d11fd65d97bef4c20f14460bb281a02b9879c40fe46069984fc81ff6f41c961", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000005-p000-9a96447c56", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 5, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "乙丑丙寅日是阿羅漢尊長者與天神下降有人設齋還愿者萬倍衣祿財寶自然吉慶大吉利", "source_sha256": "9a96447c569680d331d16633ef86cf16d49b29a69421dd07885c39e551b5e05b", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000006-p000-5959ace6b2", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 6, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "丁卯日是司命檢齋有人祈禱還愿者返善爲惡妨人口大凶可忌", "source_sha256": "5959ace6b2e3bec6410d7dc3481becebb454e25b9333bddca8c4edb21fdcf615", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000007-p000-87b7b03d29", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 7, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "戊辰巳巳日是那吒太子撿齋若人設醮還福返 善爲惡妨人口大凶", "source_sha256": "87b7b03d29decaf33cf8adf6086287e5d17588f605c0c1581e59c56d8ee4be24", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000008-p000-d2ffd04dd7", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 8, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "庚午日是青衣童子在世撿齋還福者主萬倍富 貴典旺大吉", "source_sha256": "d2ffd04dd7454fc8395dfa7d331d10219133b26442edbb53794e60c9eb983875", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000009-p000-ba453c6c76", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 9, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "辛未日是三途餓鬼在世撿齋選愿者至三年破財損六畜大凶", "source_sha256": "ba453c6c76061abf79c75f1cbd6fd3599d579a81af49f2afa86b6260b7336265", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000010-p000-13b2a4d641", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 10, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "壬申癸酉日是判官在世撿齋還愿者至一年內 有禍大凶", "source_sha256": "13b2a4d6419aa45533bfc0f81b2829657b21a89f65460b909c9353e9489dc490", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000011-p000-beb6acc972", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 11, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "甲戌乙亥丙子丁丑戊寅巳卯六日是馬鳴王菩薩檢齋得無量福萬事大吉利", "source_sha256": "beb6acc972a5e09605fc92dd7b9fd1a794b45db14fe24f036eaded0fe0e5b940", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000012-p000-a8123a50d5", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 12, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "庚辰辛巳壬午日是稱神惡鬼在世設齋主傷 遠擇紀全", "source_sha256": "a8123a50d5fa8d1065f424ee3ae8502ed263c8c6102caf5acfdbb32301cc8afb", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000013-p000-df0e484727", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 13, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "人口生灾家中常有血光火燭一年大凶癸未日是野婦羅刹設齋主一年內人口破散大凶", "source_sha256": "df0e484727fde5e5159287d41fdc1138f0a59b27d0eb0aec4e0fe5f87821d480", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000014-p000-013995fc21", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 14, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "甲申乙酉丙戍三日是彌陀佛說法之日設齋遷愿者主三年內獲福萬倍子孫興耻龍神獲祐百事大吉", "source_sha256": "013995fc21622164b0bc521bf26e59ccd5cdf4cb9ad5f446e5542e6b07550a1a", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000015-p000-de54ef8bb1", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 15, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "丁亥日是朱雀神在世設齋還愿者官灾口舌疾", "source_sha256": "de54ef8bb18468521bf9afe1d2df6b05c18ba84f3b18953d53ef0a3193c9b525", "locked_terms": ["朱雀"], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000016-p000-7e7910cb84", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 16, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "戊子日是冥司差極忌神在世設齋還愿書三", "source_sha256": "7e7910cb84dd180fbf59eae6a247754cdaa4e38bb442502c6afc131981e4094c", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000017-p000-679b82263c", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 17, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "年遇遭官事口舌是非疾病此日大凶巳丑日是司命真君差童子在世檢齋還愿者王人口安康獲福無量此日平安", "source_sha256": "679b82263cd16cf6c0098d92f66cfb8d7309601e4ff14932da7c922dce6c5758", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000018-p000-5eaa8dd5bd", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 18, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "庚寅辛卯日是畜神在世設齋還願者主一年內", "source_sha256": "5eaa8dd5bd3ba9161c3a6d080d216a102edb4a460bfa8fc8d731d84460518fa0", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000019-p000-c1e15286bc", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 19, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "破財損畜是非大凶", "source_sha256": "c1e15286bc0f57789fee633ca95182a5eff9783236b0a766422e8818c67ea07a", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000020-p000-4d8c6333ec", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 20, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "壬辰日是阿難尊者與青衣童子在世設齋還願者主子孫昌盛獲福無量三年大吉利", "source_sha256": "4d8c6333ec572d55ff9a2a350b60c67be111fa7be11b05555ca43411ebd7541b", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000021-p000-a362b15749", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 21, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "癸巳日是惡神遊行設齋還愿者王年年不利大 凶", "source_sha256": "a362b157493c374727d3df544ffa187bee4659b4067ccb7059e9f7a7e8fee3d1", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000022-p000-a4c3313deb", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 22, "part_index": 0, "kind": "other", "translatable": false, "language_hint": "mixed", "source": "三", "source_sha256": "a4c3313deb180960469d0e79a770b9deee47fdeed74fe0f74d0bf51006fcc4f0", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000023-p000-e99c292a4a", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 23, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "甲午乙未丙申丁酉戊戌巳亥庚子辛丑八日是文殊普賢與青衣童子在世檢齋還願者此且獲福無量百事大吉", "source_sha256": "e99c292a4aec2217c8dafe60af017d499f422cd3a79ff8ea3087f51d63ddfb9e", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000024-p000-2151cd0a7f", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 24, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "壬寅癸卯日是觀音菩薩行化之日設齋還愿者 王兄孫得福後世生淨土所生男子十相俱足", "source_sha256": "2151cd0a7fc62058942e23164ce5fab3a82e8f58d04e28594b953c74d1c29b59", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000025-p000-5425830bfd", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 25, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "甲辰乙巳日县入下四角大神在世檢齋還愿者 返善爲惡人眷生灾大凶", "source_sha256": "5425830bfd9c2b9e0f188b762e3aae40caede1ebc5a7146e78b8dc68bff54fc7", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000026-p000-ba23a3bfea", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 26, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "丙午丁未日是牛頭夜乂在世檢齋還願者人子", "source_sha256": "ba23a3bfeafcc18fee77ecb6ac28380be9f76bfce47d4d12cdd7f121ad30c3c2", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000027-p000-3854877a31", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 27, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "信用者三年內傷人日此日大凶戊申巳酉日是千佛下世設齋酬恩了願福利倍子孫昌盛財物興旺六畜孳生大吉庚戌辛亥日是一切賢聖同降遊行天下若人祈福者獲福無量大吉", "source_sha256": "3854877a31f91dbb62c549fd619255265fff4a497dea0302903487e5a7812f2f", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000028-p000-dcaa05bdc1", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 28, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "壬子癸丑甲寅乙卯四日是諸佛賢聖同惡樹設齋者此日平平", "source_sha256": "dcaa05bdc1cf57f593a0c2c93e1e10a2493ad9ce7dc36e658ba4be4ee3222099", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000029-p000-bd8400d52f", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 29, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "丙辰丁巳日是大頭金剛在世設齋者此日大凶 戊午日是諸聖不受愿心不明此日大凶", "source_sha256": "bd8400d52fec88bfc1c85a340319ba79aa09afbb4cadf4f66037ae7208b32b2f", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000030-p000-abd06a142c", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 30, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "巳未日是釋迦如來同菩薩在世設齋酬恩者禮 利無量大吉", "source_sha256": "abd06a142cfa4fe2cd09aace6013442055e6f9ecfc9c188020151e11eab09464", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000031-p000-f8ec378268", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 31, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "庚申辛酉日是釋迦如來說法之日設齋酬恩者福利無量家宅富貴興旺子孫昌盛主大古利", "source_sha256": "f8ec378268fa090b9b510f3b71056e6384892c132197edd9446ee856684167d1", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000032-p000-dbded8099b", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 32, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "王戍癸亥日是諸佛不撿齋之日大凶 聞皇極玉記秘於大有之庭出自太虛玉匣之 內自眞君許始有立焉選擇紀者藏於西上寶 塔之上自三藏貞觀初現此分二教建善之文 二多巳巳庚午辛未壬申甲戌乙亥戊寅巳卯壬午 甲申乙酉戊子甲午乙未丙申壬寅丙午丁未戊 申巳酉甲寅乙卯巳未庚申辛酉定成開 忌刀砧柔斧頭殺龍虎受死天賊月破危日山 九土鬼正四廢魁罡日 竹木不蛙", "source_sha256": "dbded8099b9e744c69f89628da3b57cedd5292befc52751929cb9f792e33d9e2", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000033-p000-b6298ab61d", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 33, "part_index": 0, "kind": "image", "translatable": false, "language_hint": "none", "source": "![](assets/book006/doc002/5420aa7ca2d5e61e0a4f9efb7f972a011611b52d5376825f460236b47f1cd763.jpg)", "source_sha256": "b6298ab61d17ece92d69913553e9c9555e9187569af13af3acc3827cd3c4e2cd", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000034-p000-a6a30ba5cf", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 34, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "之亥甲辰壬辰丙辰每月初五巳前遇忌日建宮室", "source_sha256": "a6a30ba5cfa567b7675fceb50c4a9bd03f4d2b47115b694fc95a71242546de18", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000035-p000-fc384e909c", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 35, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "與起造同安明堂玉堂黃道大明三帝星及五帝擇日免全", "source_sha256": "fc384e909c611dbab72d46fe67264a63f35d0dbacad87246a4666468c6b96fa0", "locked_terms": ["明堂"], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000036-p000-5f54f71832", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 36, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "生日忌天灾天火地火雷火月火獨火火星魁星", "source_sha256": "5f54f7183248b83c9c9cfd11ce57b38c6ac98db342b9aac6e2976d39a6c777b6", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
