{"id": "book006-b000085-p000-3b2962d92f", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 85, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "妖星值日凶", "source_sha256": "3b2962d92ffc4e84d9390d826b9ae733a3312c975da8aeeda76b7f3d8011bed8", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000086-p000-21e8f41eb6", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 86, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "如值此星者名爲玄武入宅凢遇人家起造嫁娶秋徒上官匙任聞張興店出人祭祀等項不出一年再主人口凶連遭官非動作安葬失財被盜牢禁刑獄人口落水四百日內有疾病孝服損財口舌自東直年日紀全 克", "source_sha256": "21e8f41eb698248118985d8f7c888329f32435dc75cda06947df8bd17296a90e", "locked_terms": ["水", "玄武"], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000087-p000-1a9265b42c", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 87, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "方來三年內大凶卽齊星是也", "source_sha256": "1a9265b42cc1b3e77ce217797dccea61f44f352929771463e73ac59672db3376", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000088-p000-9e03946cef", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 88, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "武星值日凶", "source_sha256": "9e03946cef84523e064701d284767c70f9bf5689c0e14f6bf3bfbf5d3a69571e", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000089-p000-9052b94bc5", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 89, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "如值此星者名日朱雀入宅主當年火盜怪灾一日落一日官非財散六畜傷疾男女淫亂缺唇喪服只空安安墳若有他事不美此星卽火星也", "source_sha256": "9052b94bc5b82b0b2087de9fab6521c3f123186e401e59a295c179e854eea5e1", "locked_terms": ["朱雀"], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000090-p000-5121d15658", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 90, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "和星值日凶如值此星者名日白虎入宅凡一應嫁娶上官開囊等事不出一年之內損財疾病缺虎咬蛇傷官非漢亂若有積陰德之人見血灾奴婢當災也", "source_sha256": "5121d1565853d5b81e6d2a9a17eb22ceed727df3fc6812f984e51c6ee4c4e3e5", "locked_terms": ["白虎"], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000091-p000-622ba416a7", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 91, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "朴星值日凶如值此星者名日黑殺入宅几過造作嫁娶店肆等事不出一年內主瘋疾之人見凶更有火盜官灾淫亂虎咬蛇傷若本人有福立見虛耗不祥之意", "source_sha256": "622ba416a72fd7ce2a0f9b419d4fdc7e2eaae7eb89c1a0a26374d8eab474ef4a", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000092-p000-3e7d562982", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 92, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "如值此星者名日金櫃六令青龍天德星入宅凡人 家修造嫁娶開店鋪上官出行等不三年內官者 祿老者增壽今家孝順百事稱心所謂大吉慶喜如 意者卽顯星也", "source_sha256": "3e7d562982c1096b28823ce683f207fe47f6360ed46045e8f9e34cb34ef817e7", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000093-p000-536e6c4b95", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 93, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "釋目純全 二十", "source_sha256": "536e6c4b95cfe8cc4fbd6962994ed6e92bb3247350e11a86cf1011b5553d4a2a", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000094-p000-5ec4f17d13", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 94, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "傳星值日吉", "source_sha256": "5ec4f17d13b72d8ae9e53afc3349ae8dc1176be8591974517acf4e3551145dae", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000095-p000-3f42646e5a", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 95, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "如值此星者名日太陰金堂入宅凢遇造作嫁娶上官赴任開張店舖移徙入宅出行等事不出一年之內主生貴子三年之間有位至公卿無官得福無量所謂吉慶財斧豐餘得外人財喜用自然交集者卽葉微星也", "source_sha256": "3f42646e5adf4ec70169b6269cfacb99db4d70f13f470d660bfb19b8253a465c", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000096-p000-c1762970cb", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 96, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "前星值日吉", "source_sha256": "c1762970cbff02bab1a696d7bd9e17364dba1fa852c9179421a0cda763efc0c4", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000097-p000-499fd56da7", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 97, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "一如值此星者名日玉堂入宅凡人家修造嫁娶開店上官出行不出三年內官位高遷田委與隆男貴女清決招橫財百事稱心若遇金神七煞凶至年一一日先吉後主灾失財多遭官事此卽文曲星也如無不遇金神七煞此日上好", "source_sha256": "499fd56da7a41235c63be0d3d4b8222c11e7dbf4370179dd5982dd8f79848186", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000098-p000-ea0ed3291b", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 98, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "角星值日凶", "source_sha256": "ea0ed3291be4b8caee61ca07deb479ba51f0efc58ca5a0bf1c27b26b11508cac", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000099-p000-06e64c5240", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 99, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "如值此星者名曰太陽符入宅凡嫁愛造作赴任出行不過三年內主遭官灾火盜更忌生產外若主人有陰德只見口舌經答謝此卽解星也", "source_sha256": "06e64c52402cc9b6eff454a7d6e94bab28149aa4f9239aef9fc8ff2edd6dbc9d", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000100-p000-a1ed239de1", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 100, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "如值此星者名日勾陳符入宅凢遇造作嫁娶開張擇日純全 主", "source_sha256": "a1ed239de1f369d3095374afd482db156ddd81f837ca8bc2700504cfee198b27", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000101-p000-beaaf73c4d", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 101, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "店舍赴任出行安葬等事不出一年內主有人口退散官灾火盜如上樣造船可見匠人皿光之灾主人要與諸家曆書不同陰陽不同人口救苦經亦宅又日靈經異書莫傳與天下遇人如七煞星雖遇吉神亦不可用有失有散", "source_sha256": "beaaf73c4d8a1aae2fe483edecd71582065362ce75e62572f85ff0c137f17407", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000102-p000-d029a62cb5", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 102, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "一九天 星玫联活 凡造作奧工從福星起福 壹歲至德星順數輪轉至其年星位權月宅德星入命宜修造注壽延年爲兆自作添進人反北方田宅財旺富貴之吉兆也宅福星入命空修造興工三財進益四宅典旺大吉利也", "source_sha256": "d029a62cb58e96c5531d285bfb877434129d3152dbb687f53c6f0b13ddc2be85", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000103-p000-d9a5f2de19", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 103, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "宅祿星入命空修造屋此年修造不論錢動土輿工不用十六十日橫財來天地龍神自降福", "source_sha256": "d9a5f2de194fdb965549a541aad06f4a58dfbf264a59997671bfa6f00765ee70", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000104-p000-750e3ae485", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 104, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "宅寶星入命是祥星若逢修造必添丁造屋未威上財至子孫昌順後頭典旺", "source_sha256": "750e3ae485f58ad8daacc2951989949fc7ecf8e667721cac240d4bab53dbcbc8", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000105-p000-dabfbaf7e9", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 105, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "宅敗星人命名下虛耗若興工造作立生灾殃如不擇日紀全 主", "source_sha256": "dabfbaf7e9bd8a1870bb27cde41cc95fccada283a12cc3756a923b57faea9cf9", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
