{"id": "book006-b000107-p000-1ad4d1aeb6", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 107, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "宅虎星守命不宜修造若見灾驚小修未可龍虎入宮動土修濠可歇安寧", "source_sha256": "1ad4d1aeb66732704d3b691da04d5917b8de505ac11018f58d20c37c5be7e282", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
{"id": "book006-b000108-p000-1fb31d3057", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 108, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "宅天之年多禍凶難依作福保陰功握鑿造作人不信二年之內見貧窮", "source_sha256": "1fb31d30572f6a6a920051bd080d4539ee99320a378bf65fa3bc481168cb44fc", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
