{"id": "book006-b000110-p000-0c1659fec2", "book_no": 6, "book_file": "006 选择纪全.md", "block_index": 110, "part_index": 0, "kind": "prose", "translatable": true, "language_hint": "classical_or_modern_chinese", "source": "宅欽星運福過圍修造之工立見顏憑汝豪強福義 且未成先巳身危", "source_sha256": "0c1659fec264e441eb4cdac5a5a55e6ccf79f7ee4ee606e3aba286153c9f9220", "locked_terms": [], "opaque_terms": []}
